      <title>麒麟9050单核GB6跑分2084：新架构把电压压下来了</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260904/%E9%BA%92%E9%BA%9F9050%E5%8D%95%E6%A0%B8GB6%E8%B7%91%E5%88%862084%E6%96%B0%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%8A%8A%E7%94%B5%E5%8E%8B%E5%8E%8B%E4%B8%8B%E6%9D%A5%E4%BA%86/</link>
